    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1codeview_1_1_c_v_record" kindref="compound">CVRecord</ref> is a fat pointer (base + size pair) to a symbol or type record. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Carrying the size separately instead of trusting the size stored in the record prefix provides some extra safety and flexibility. </para>
